ion for the 2006 American film Mission: Impossible III. In February 2012, he independently released his debut studio album, Pineapple Now-Laters. Sledge subsequently secured a record deal with Motown, in August 2012. The label then serviced the Pineapple Now-Laters song \"Good Luv'n\", as Sledge's commercial debut single.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:1641822","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":410252,"name":"Bryan Sledge"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["B.J.","B.J. The Chicago Kid","BJ","BJ The Chigaco Kid","Bj The Chiago Kid","Chicago"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/1641822-BJ-The-Chicago-Kid","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.facebook.com/bjthechicagokid","https://www.instagram.com/bjthechicagokid/","https://soundcloud.com/b-j-the-chicago-kid","https://www.tiktok.com/@iambjthechicagokid","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BJ_the_Chicago_Kid","https://twitter.com/BJTHECHICAGOKID","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQfYvnxjucGHJ2QZoNgPd8A"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/26921/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"26921","image":"https://i.discogs.com/u7o9P9aCdKILuqJEP95RiKmCmnAlM9I1Rp6sLZjQCTE/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:400/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTI2OTIx/LTE2Njk0MDI0NDct/MTYxNC5wbmc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/KALoh4nS72txsbs-CtI42bmGTIDdjCAxuDom43fQ44c/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTI2OTIx/LTE2Njk0MDI0NDct/MTYxNC5wbmc.jpeg","profile":"American rock group formed in 1988, from Omaha, Nebraska.\r\n\r\n[b]Members[/b]\r\nNick Hexum – Vocals, Rhythm guitar, Programming (1988–present)\r\nDoug \"[a=S.A. (3)]\" Martinez – Vocals, Turntables, DJ (1992–present)\r\nTim Mahoney – Lead guitar (1991–present)\r\nAaron \"[a=P-Nut (4)]\" Wills – Bass (1988–present)\r\nChad Sexton – Drums, Percussion, Programming (1988–present)\r\n\r\n[b]Former Members[/b]\r\nJim \"Jimi\" Watson – Guitar (1988–1991)\r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:26921","re